<title>ITALY: Italy Senate commission approves Autostrade plan.</title>
<headline>Italy Senate commission approves Autostrade plan.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The public works commission of Italy's Senate (upper house) voted on Wednesday in favour of government plans to privatise Italy's main motorway operator, Autostrade Spa, parliamentary officials said.</p>
<p>The vote in the Senate commission followed by several hours a similar vote in favour of the plan by the environment commission of the lower house, the Chamber of Deputies.</p>
<p>The centre-left government plans to sell Autostrade, now owned by state holding IRI, by June.</p>
<p>Both commissions had been required to express an opinion on the planned sale.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +39 6 678 2505</p>
